%% Diagram source: core scenario for the knowledge docs.
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as cli.py
    participant Engine as scenarios/base.py
    participant Factory as repos/factory.py
    participant VCS as real Git/jj
    participant Evidence as evidence/recorder.py

    User->>CLI: ./lab scenario run NAME
    CLI->>Engine: resolve Scenario
    Engine->>Factory: create topology
    Factory->>VCS: git init / clone; jj git clone --colocate
    Engine->>Engine: ARRANGE
    Engine->>VCS: before snapshot
    Engine->>VCS: ACT operation
    Engine->>VCS: OBSERVE after snapshot
    Engine->>Engine: ASSERT semantic invariants
    Engine->>Evidence: REPORT command log + snapshots
    Evidence-->>User: PASS + evidence path
